Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fritz has done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N弗里茨做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:15.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Taylor Fritz is the champion in Stockholm in 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N弗里茨夺得斯德哥尔摩冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:20.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Finally, he has his first ever indoor title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终于 他拿到生涯首个室内冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:23.41,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴黎那一周 弗里茨握着两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后却没能击败阿卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.67,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一周之后 北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他在斯德哥尔摩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:32.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}赢得生涯首个室内冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:35.64,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一周 他怎样走到这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:39.79,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首轮轮空后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:42.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他用{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}击败诺里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:44.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}迈过这周的第一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:58.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Such a good return, which actually Norrie dealt with very well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次接发很好 诺里也应对得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:01.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He just then completely mishit the forehand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N只是随后那拍正手完全没打好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:08.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And ace number 13 sees him through the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第十三记直接得分 送他赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:12.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And after what happened last week...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在经历上周那场比赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:15.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛 鲁内赛前因腿伤退出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:18.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}弗里茨直接晋级半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛再遇穆塞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:28.53,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}弗里茨用两盘争到最后一场的门票
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:45.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been an absolute blitz from Fritz in Stockholm.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N弗里茨在斯德哥尔摩打出凌厉一战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:50.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A real masterclass from the top seed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子打出了一场示范
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:53.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And in double quick time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且赢得相当快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:54.67,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛对面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:58.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}是首次打进巡回赛决赛的蒂兰特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:02:00.57,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一盘 弗里茨两次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:01.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:05.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他用反手直线收下第一盘 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:17.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time he's made it. What a way to bring up the set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次打成了 多精彩的首盘收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:21.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}蒂兰特在弗里茨的发球局找到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:24.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68} 这一分没能守住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:26.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}局势就此改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:40.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}发球 蒂兰特来到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:42.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}弗里茨最后一拍反手下网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比赛进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:05.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Stockholm final will have a deciding set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯德哥尔摩决赛要打决胜盘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:09.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘 双方{\fs78}12{\fs68}个发球局全部保住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谁都没拿到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}冠军只能在抢七里争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:16.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后 弗里茨拿下{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fritz has done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N弗里茨做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:33.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Taylor Fritz is the champion in Stockholm in 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N弗里茨夺得斯德哥尔摩冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:37.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Finally, he has his first ever indoor title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终于 他拿到生涯首个室内冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the 12th of his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯第十二座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But boy, oh boy, it was hard work.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这一场 赢得实在不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:48.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He was pushed all the way by Thiago Tirante,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N蒂兰特把他逼到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:50.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on his debut, remember, in a final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是蒂兰特的首场巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:55.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But maybe in the end, it was all about experience.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也许最后起作用的 还是经验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:59.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是他第{\fs78}12{\fs68}座巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}也是继华盛顿之后的赛季第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:03.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴黎的遗憾之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他用奖杯结束这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:10.85,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}弗里茨制胜分{\fs78}22{\fs68} 蒂兰特{\fs78}35{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:13.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}非受迫失误{\fs78}21{\fs68}对{\fs78}36{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:17.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这场决赛 你最记得哪一个关键分？
